{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23130","headline":"中书连直寒食不归因怀元九 · 白居易","name":"中书连直寒食不归因怀元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁清明日，南巴古郡楼。\n今年寒食夜，西省凤池头。\n并上新人直，难随旧伴游。\n诚知视草贵，未免对花愁。\n鬓发茎茎日，光阴寸寸流。\n经春不同宿，何异在忠州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}